      "role": "user",
      "content": "oh okay thanks. i was a bit worried but that sounds fine. i actually have a lot of grapefruit in the house right now though so i'll probably still have a pretty big glass. is there a specific amount that's actually dangerous? like if i have like two glasses, is that gonna mess with the medicine or something?",
